  "description": "看了 YouTube 推荐的三个教“专业跑法”的视频，发现全是误导。",
  "body_html": "<p><span>看了 YouTube 推荐的三个教“专业跑法”的视频，发现全是误导。</span></p><div id=\"youtube2-andAaS6Lyc8\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;andAaS6Lyc8&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/andAaS6Lyc8?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><div id=\"youtube2-sIxAoC8P8zg\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;sIxAoC8P8zg&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/sIxAoC8P8zg?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><div id=\"youtube2-ohyG-Mek_To\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;ohyG-Mek_To&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ohyG-Mek_To?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><p>看来体育运动都是这样的，网络上绝大部分信息都是误导。</p><p><span>之前我提到过在日本参加一个“跑团”的故事。新来的一个领跑者居然问我：“你是从什么时候开始跑步的？（When did you start running?）” 我说：“Since I was born.” 他还很惊讶的样子。</span></p><p><span>其实我的意思是，我生下来学会了走路，后来就会跑了。按照「running」这个词的定义，确实就是如此。谁还不会跑呢？</span></p><p><span>但总是有人跟你说，这样的跑姿不对，你要这样那样着地才是科学的，专业选手不是你那样跑的。你这样跑平时可以，但跑不了马拉松……</span></p><p><span>如果你听信了他的，过一段时间也许就会发现——你受伤了。</span></p><p><span>别听这些人鬼扯“怎么跑”。每个人，每只动物都会跑。有本事你去教教猫，狗和猎豹怎么跑？它们专业地学过吗？世界上有人跑得过哪怕一只普通胖猫吗？</span></p><p><span>人一般1岁半到2岁就会跑了。没人需要别人来教自己怎么跑。</span></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S1pX!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe3c5bd8f-dfc8-4ee2-9104-b7a34be136bb_2560x1440.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S1pX!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe3c5bd8f-dfc8-4ee2-9104-b7a34be136bb_2560x1440.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S1pX!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe3c5bd8f-dfc8-4ee2-9104-b7a34be136bb_2560x1440.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S1pX!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe3c5bd8f-dfc8-4ee2-9104-b7a34be136bb_2560x1440.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S1pX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe3c5bd8f-dfc8-4ee2-9104-b7a34be136bb_2560x1440.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S1pX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe3c5bd8f-dfc8-4ee2-9104-b7a34be136bb_2560x1440.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e3c5bd8f-dfc8-4ee2-9104-b7a34be136bb_2560x1440.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:819,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:5036182,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://yinwang1.substack.com/i/209901226?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe3c5bd8f-dfc8-4ee2-9104-b7a34be136bb_2560x1440.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S1pX!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe3c5bd8f-dfc8-4ee2-9104-b7a34be136bb_2560x1440.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S1pX!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe3c5bd8f-dfc8-4ee2-9104-b7a34be136bb_2560x1440.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S1pX!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe3c5bd8f-dfc8-4ee2-9104-b7a34be136bb_2560x1440.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S1pX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe3c5bd8f-dfc8-4ee2-9104-b7a34be136bb_2560x1440.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p></p>",
